Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:25.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘣 嘣\N{\fs50}Pew, pew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:28.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘣\N{\fs50}Pew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:53.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这事儿每小时都得来一遍吗？\N{\fs50}We have to do this every hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,时间久了 汽油会分解\N{\fs50}Gas breaks down over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些几乎都成水了\N{\fs50}This stuff's almost water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:03:00.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在过去 一箱油可以开10到12小时\N{\fs50}Back in the day, we'd drive 10, 12 hours on one tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:01.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随你想去哪儿都行\N{\fs50}You could go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你去了哪儿？\N{\fs50}So where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:07.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,几乎哪儿都没去过\N{\fs50}Pretty much nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:10.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,牛逼哇！这什么原理？\N{\fs50}Nice! How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:12.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是虹吸管\N{\fs50}It's a siphon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:18.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当液体……在气压的作用下 逆重力流动——\N{\fs50}It's when liquid... travels against gravity because pressure--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:19.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实你不知道原理\N{\fs50}You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.15,0:03:21.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么弄就行\N{\fs50}I know it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:22.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别到处乱跑\N{\fs50}No wandering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:32.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那接下来都怪你\N{\fs50}This is your fault then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:41.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“无论怎么敦促那个信封\N{\fs50}"It doesn't matter how much you push the envelope,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:45.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它照样还是个文具”\N{\fs50}it'll still be stationery."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:45.11,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,push the envelope：接近或达到极致；stationery谐音stationary（静止不动）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:50.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,, 《扣钱谐音梗 第二卷》 作者威尔·莱文斯顿\N{\fs50}"No Pun Intended, Volume Too" by Will Livingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“量也很大” 看 你领会了吗？\N{\fs50}"Volume Too." Look. You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:54.09,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,Volume：1、卷，2、数量大；Two（二）、Too（也）谐音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 瞧 也 也 - 老天啊\N{\fs50}-"Too"? Like, T-o-o. -Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“美人鱼上数学课穿什么？”\N{\fs50}"What did the mermaid wear to her math class?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:03.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“海藻胸罩”\N{\fs50}"An algae bra."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:06.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,居然是海藻胸罩\N{\fs50}Like, algae bra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:06.91,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,algae bra谐音algebra（代数）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:08.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- “我整晚没睡—— - 停\N{\fs50}-"I stayed up all night-- -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:10.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“思前想后 不知太阳去哪儿了……\N{\fs50}"wondering where the sun went...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“突然它启明了我” \N{\fs50}and then it dawned on me."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:12.58,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,dawn：1、黎明、破晓，2、认识到、明白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:13.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还是去车里等我吧\N{\fs50}Feel free to wait in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哎 好吧\N{\fs50}Ugh, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:18.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你要明白 你躲不掉威尔·莱文斯顿\N{\fs50}but just know, you can't escape Will Livingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他会回来的\N{\fs50}He'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:23.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没法阻止他\N{\fs50}There's nothing you can do to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:38.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一定是某种卡车弄出来的\N{\fs50}Must've been some truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:40.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 装上超大号的犁\N{\fs50}Yeah, they used to stick big-ass plows on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:42.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,用来清理路面 为坦克之类的开路\N{\fs50}and clear the roads for their tanks and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想看坦克\N{\fs50}I wanna see a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:46.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会有机会的\N{\fs50}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:49.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,坦克 直升机 这类东西\N{\fs50}Tanks, choppers, all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:51.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但他们选错了敌人\N{\fs50}But they'll fight the wrong enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:53.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,残骸随处可见\N{\fs50}Just scattered around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:58.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我找到了好东西\N{\fs50}I got somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看这 让你想起过往了吗？\N{\fs50}Here. This make you all nostalgic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:05.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这歌比我老得多\N{\fs50}This is actually before my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fs50}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不过 这歌挺流行\N{\fs50}It's a winner, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:14.41,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,Hank Williams《Alone and Forsaken》，发表于1951年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:15.44,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,我们在春日相遇 百花争艳 齐齐绽放\N{\fs50}♪ We met in the springtime when blossoms unfold ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,牛逼\N{\fs50}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:18.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看我发现了什么好东西\N{\fs50}Got somethin' else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:25.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这 呃 没几个字 倒是有一些有趣的照片\N{\fs50}It's, uh... light on the reading, but it has some interesting pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:28.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 别 别 别看 把这杂志放回去 少儿不宜 艾莉\N{\fs50}Oh. No, no, no. Put that back. That's not for kids. Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这人怎么露着那玩意儿到处走？\N{\fs50}How would he even walk around with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 拜托你 把它放下 - 别急嘛\N{\fs50}-Please get rid of it. -Hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就想看看这里有啥好大惊小怪的\N{\fs50}I wanna see what all the fuss is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:39.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为啥这几页都粘到一起了\N{\fs50}Why are all these pages stuck together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呃……那是——\N{\fs50}Uhh... the--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:44.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我他妈是逗你的\N{\fs50}I'm just fuckin' with ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜拜了 哥们儿\N{\fs50}Bye-bye, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:56.52,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,失去所爱 永远孤独 被命运和爱人遗弃\N{\fs50}♪ Alone and forsaken by fate and by man ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:06:01.27,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 如果你听到我的祷告 求你握住我的手\N{\fs50}♪ Oh Lord, if you hear me, please hold to my hand ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:05.90,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,请谅解我\N{\fs50}♪ Oh, please understand ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:08.28,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,我的爱人去往何处\N{\fs50}♪ Oh, where has she gone to ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:10.95,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,她当前身在何方\N{\fs50}♪ Oh, where can she be ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:15.58,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,她可能遗弃了其他人 就像她对我那样\N{\fs50}♪ She may have forsaken some other like me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:21.29,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,她曾许诺 荣耀上帝 爱人如己 遵从福音\N{\fs50}♪ She promised to honor, to love, and obey ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:28.38,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,每一句誓言 都是她扔掉的玩物\N{\fs50}♪ Each vow was a plaything that she threw away ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:33.35,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,黑暗降临 天色渐灰\N{\fs50}♪ The darkness is fallin', the sky has turned gray ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:39.23,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,远处的猎犬 开始吠叫\N{\fs50}♪ A hound in the distance is starting to bay ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:43.98,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,我心彷徨 忧心爱人所思所想\N{\fs50}♪ I wonder, I wonder what she's thinkin' of ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:50.32,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,被遗弃 被遗忘 无爱可诉 无爱可依\N{\fs50}♪ Forsaken, forgotten without any love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 今天不往前走了\N{\fs50}All right. That's enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:45.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,慢点吃\N{\fs50}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我已经放慢了\N{\fs50}This is slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我吃的是啥？\N{\fs50}What am I even eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:52.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,20年的主厨博亚迪做的意大利方饺\N{\fs50}That is 20-year-old Chef Boyardee ravioli.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:54.60,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs48}主厨博亚迪（Chef Boyardee）：美国罐装食品品牌，\N某宝某东一般叫“美国男厨”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这主厨手艺真好\N{\fs50}That guy was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:55.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么说我同意\N{\fs50}I actually agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:02.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要在这儿待多久？\N{\fs50}How long we staying out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:03.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想想 今晚睡一晚……\N{\fs50}I figure I sleep tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:06.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明天开上一天一夜\N{\fs50}and drive tomorrow all day, all night,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,后天我们就可以到怀俄明了\N{\fs50}get us to Wyoming by next mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:10.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要生火吗？我冻死了\N{\fs50}So can we start a fire? I'm freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 你猜猜我为什么要说不行？\N{\fs50}Now, why am I gonna tell you no?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:13.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为感染者会看到营火的烟\N{\fs50}Because Infected will see the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:16.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不对 真菌没那么聪明\N{\fs50}No. Fungus isn't that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:18.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,实际上 这里离它们远着呢\N{\fs50}This is too remote for Infected, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:23.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,难道是人？\N{\fs50}People?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们会对我们做什么？抢劫？\N{\fs50}So what are they gonna do? Rob us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:28.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 他们的想法多的是 花样百出\N{\fs50}Oh, they'll have way more in mind than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:33.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:44.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实还蛮好闻的\N{\fs50}Actually smells kinda good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:48.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 那估计就是弗兰克的睡袋了\N{\fs50}Well, that would be Frank's then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:31.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:37.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,干吗？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:40.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可以问你个严肃的问题吗？\N{\fs50}Can I ask you a serious question?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.85,0:09:41.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:50.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“为什么稻草人得了奖？”\N{\fs50}"Why did the scarecrow get an award?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:58.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为它在自己那片田野上很突出\N{\fs50}Because he was outstanding in his field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:01.01,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,field：1、田野，2、领域
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你个混蛋！\N{\fs50}You dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:01.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你读过这书？\N{\fs50}Did you read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:04.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 快睡觉\N{\fs50}Now go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说的那些人…\N{\fs50}Those people you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:33.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们不可能知道我们在这儿 对不对？\N{\fs50}there's no way anyone knows we're here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:36.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人能找到我们\N{\fs50}No one's gonna find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:42.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人能找到我们\N{\fs50}No one's gonna find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:47.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:51.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呕！这他妈是什么？\N{\fs50}Ugh! The fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:53.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢咖啡？\N{\fs50}You don't like coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:15.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说真的 隔离区里的星巴克之前真的卖这个？\N{\fs50}Is that seriously what those Starbucks in the QZ used to sell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,虽然店里卖的比起比尔这些存货新鲜得多\N{\fs50}Well, theirs was a lot fresher than what Bill saved up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:20.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但 没错 他们卖的就是这类东西\N{\fs50}but, yeah, this is what they sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闻起来像烧焦的屎\N{\fs50}Smells like burnt shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:32.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好好看地图\N{\fs50}Eyes on the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:37.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,76号州际公路往西 然后……\N{\fs50}76 west and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:41.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,70号公路 继续往西走……一直走\N{\fs50}70 west for, like, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:43.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说你兄弟在怀俄明哪里来着？\N{\fs50}Where in Wyoming did you say your brother was?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他最后一次联络我们 是在科迪附近的无线电塔\N{\fs50}Last contact came through a radio tower close to Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:47.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,科迪\N{\fs50}Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,科迪 啊 老兄 真是荒野深处\N{\fs50}Cody. Ah, man. That is deep up in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:53.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 如果他不在那里呢？\N{\fs50}-Yeah. -And if he's not there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么他很有可能在某个定居点附近\N{\fs50}Then odds are he'll be near a settlement,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或者在某个城市附近\N{\fs50}probably close to another city out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:00.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怀俄明没多少地方\N{\fs50}Ain't too many of 'em in Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:02.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,芝延\N{\fs50}Chee-Yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:03.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是夏延\N{\fs50}Cheyenne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,夏——真的？\N{\fs50}Che-- really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:08.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,夏延……拉勒米……\N{\fs50}Cheyenne... Laramie...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:10.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,卡斯珀？\N{\fs50}Casper?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:11.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他叫什么？\N{\fs50}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 你兄弟\N{\fs50}-Whose name? -Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:15.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 汤米 - 弟弟还是哥哥？\N{\fs50}-Tommy. -Younger or older?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:17.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 他是弟弟 - 你们为什么分开了？\N{\fs50}-Younger. -Why isn't he with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说来话长了\N{\fs50}A long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:19.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这故事25个小时讲不完？\N{\fs50}Is it longer than 25 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:22.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜这是我们要花在路上的时间\N{\fs50}'Cause I think that's what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过去我们管汤米这种人叫做“社团活跃分子”\N{\fs50}Tommy's what we used to call a "joiner."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他梦想成为英雄\N{\fs50}Dreams of becomin' a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:36.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以高中一毕业就参了军\N{\fs50}So he enlisted in the Army right outta high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:40.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,几个月后 他被派去参加沙漠风暴行动\N{\fs50}A few months later, they ship him off to Desert Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:42.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是他们给那场仗起的代号 这不重要\N{\fs50}It's what they called that war. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:44.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,重点是 军队生涯\N{\fs50}Point is, bein' in the Army
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,并没有让他觉得自己像个英雄\N{\fs50}didn't make him feel much like a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:49.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,转到12年后 疫情爆发\N{\fs50}Cut to 12 years later, outbreak happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:52.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他说服我加入一个团队 随他们北上去往波士顿\N{\fs50}He convinces me to join a group makin' their way up to Boston,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:54.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我照做了……主要是为了看着他\N{\fs50}which I did... mostly to keep an eye on him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,保证他的安全\N{\fs50}keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:58.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在那里我们遇到了泰丝\N{\fs50}It's where we met Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:02.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,整个小队 我们 呃——\N{\fs50}And that whole crew, we, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:06.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧 无论如何 我们成功了\N{\fs50}Well, for what it was, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:11.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而后汤米见到了玛琳\N{\fs50}And then Tommy meets Marlene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:14.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,被她说服 加入了火萤\N{\fs50}She talks him into joinin' the Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,同样的错误 就像他18岁那年一样\N{\fs50}Same mistake he made when he was 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:20.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,满脑子只想拯救世界\N{\fs50}Wants to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:25.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,白日梦 哼 火萤 全都是……\N{\fs50}Pipe dream. Him, Fireflies, all of 'em...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:28.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一场妄想\N{\fs50}delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:30.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然了 最后我听说 他也离开了火萤\N{\fs50}'Course, last I heard, he quit the Fireflies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:34.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他现在只身一人 所以……\N{\fs50}So now he's on his own out there, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:37.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我得去找他\N{\fs50}I gotta go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:44.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你认为这个世界没救了\N{\fs50}If you don't think there's hope for the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:47.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么还要继续？\N{\fs50}why bother going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想说的是 你得试试 对吧？\N{\fs50}I mean, you gotta try, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:53.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没经历过 所以你不知道\N{\fs50}You haven't seen the world, so you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:58.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是为了家人前进\N{\fs50}You keep goin' for family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 就是如此了 - 可我不是你的家人\N{\fs50}-That's about it. -I'm not family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对……\N{\fs50}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是货物 但我向泰丝做了承诺\N{\fs50}you're cargo. And I made a promise to Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:08.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而她 算是我的家人\N{\fs50}And she was like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 万一你找不到他呢？ - 我会成功的\N{\fs50}-What if you don't find him? -I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:16.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你凭什么确信这点？ - 我很执着\N{\fs50}-How do you know? -I'm persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:21.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你起得很早 如果你想再多睡会儿\N{\fs50}Ya got up pretty early. If you wanna grab more sleep--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:22.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,切 我才不累\N{\fs50}Pfft. I'm not even tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fs50}Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:01.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们现在在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,堪萨斯城\N{\fs50}Kansas City.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们还要往回走多远 才能绕过这里？\N{\fs50}How far back do we have to go to get around this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fs50}Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\N{\fs50}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以慢慢绕过这条隧道……\N{\fs50}We can jog right around this tunnel...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:27.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,开到下一个匝道……\N{\fs50}take the next ramp...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:30.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就能回到主路上 顶多几分钟的事\N{\fs50}and we're back on the road. Minute tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:49.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他妈的高速路究竟在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where the fuck is the highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:51.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没法判断 我掉向了\N{\fs50}I can't tell from this. I'm all turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:53.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别看州地图了 看那个放大图\N{\fs50}Don't look at the state map. Look at the inset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:54.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呃 我连咱们在哪都不知道！ \N{\fs50}Well, I don't know where we are in that either!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我他妈第二天坐车 老兄\N{\fs50}This is my second day in a fucking car, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:00.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜 我们正往北走？\N{\fs50}I mean, I think we're heading north?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:11.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,应该往右拐了\N{\fs50}It's gotta be the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:12.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈搞什么鬼？\N{\fs50}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.59,0:18:14.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,停车！\N{\fs50}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那边是隔离区吗？\N{\fs50}Is that the QZ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:20.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,见了鬼的FEDRA怎么没了？\N{\fs50}Where the fuck is FEDRA?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:24.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fs50}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:25.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,请帮帮我！\N{\fs50}Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,系好安全带\N{\fs50}Put your seatbelt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:31.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不帮他吗？\N{\fs50}Aren't we gonna help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:31.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fs50}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:36.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 动手 快！ - 乔尔！\N{\fs50}-Go, go, go! -Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:47.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 还行\N{\fs50}-Are you okay? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你没伤着吧？一点事都没有？ - 我应该没事\N{\fs50}-You're not hurt? Nothin'? -I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,解开安全带 快！\N{\fs50}Belts off. Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:11.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你跑不掉的 老杂种！\N{\fs50}Let's see you, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:17.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把你的家当交出来 我们会放你一马！\N{\fs50}Give us your shit, you make it through this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.11,0:19:18.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说话算话！\N{\fs50}I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 你看到墙上那个洞了吗？\N{\fs50}Hey, you see that hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:24.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你能钻过去吗？\N{\fs50}Can you squeeze through?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我最后说一次！\N{\fs50}Last chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我一说走 你就向那面墙爬过去\N{\fs50}When I say go, you crawl to that wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:31.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,钻过墙上的洞 不准出来\N{\fs50}and you squeeze through, and you don't come out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:33.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,直到我说安全了 明白吗？\N{\fs50}until I say, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:40.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们不会打中你的 看着我！\N{\fs50}And they're not gonna hit you. Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:42.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们不会打中你的\N{\fs50}They're not gonna hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你趴好了 身子放低 不要出声\N{\fs50}You stay down, you stay low, you stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:46.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:48.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fs50}-Okay. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:51.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fs50}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:15.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的！\N{\fs50}You motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:09.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在你他妈要付出代价！\N{\fs50}Now you're gonna fuckin' pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看你他妈干的好事\N{\fs50}What you fuckin' did,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.31,0:21:12.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈害死了你自己 臭傻逼！\N{\fs50}you fuckin' killed yourself, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.47,0:21:50.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不不不不不！没事了 没事了\N{\fs50}No, no, no, no, no! It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:53.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,结束了 我们不打了\N{\fs50}It's over. We're not fighting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:54.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会回家 我会告诉所有人你们没问题\N{\fs50}I'm gonna go home. I'll tell everyone you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:58.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么办了\N{\fs50}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:01.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的腿完了\N{\fs50}My legs don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:05.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我妈妈住得不远 你们能不能带我去她那儿\N{\fs50}My mom isn't far, if you could get me to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:10.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以做交易\N{\fs50}We could trade with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:12.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以做朋友 我之前搞错了\N{\fs50}We could be friends. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:14.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我叫布莱恩 我叫布莱恩\N{\fs50}I'm Bryan. I'm Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.45,0:22:16.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你叫什么？\N{\fs50}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:34.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等\N{\fs50}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.12,0:22:41.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,归你了……这是把好刀\N{\fs50}You can have it... It's a good knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.23,0:22:47.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到墙后边去\N{\fs50}Get back behind the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:48.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不不不不！我很抱歉！我很抱歉！\N{\fs50}No, no, no, no! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:49.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了 求求了 我们可以谈谈\N{\fs50}Please, please. We could just talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:51.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉！我很抱歉！\N{\fs50}I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:53.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了 不不不！求你了！\N{\fs50}Please, please. No, no, no! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不要走 求你了！求你了！我很抱歉！\N{\fs50}No, please! Please! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:22:57.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉！求你了！\N{\fs50}I'm sorry! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.37,0:22:59.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咱们没必要这样！我很抱歉！我很抱歉！\N{\fs50}You don't have to! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.37,0:23:01.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了！不不不！我们先聊聊！\N{\fs50}Please! No, no, no! We can just talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:04.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们先聊聊！妈妈！妈妈！妈妈！\N{\fs50}We can just talk! Mom! Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:12.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉 我得过来\N{\fs50}Ellie, I gotta get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:14.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我钻不进去\N{\fs50}I can't fit through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:17.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有东西抵住了门\N{\fs50}There's some stuff against the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:18.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你能移开吗？\N{\fs50}Well, can you move it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.73,0:23:26.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 该走了 快点 - 好\N{\fs50}-Let's go. Fast. -Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:34.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还好……我没事\N{\fs50}I'm okay... I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.24,0:23:36.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我这 呃 还剩了些吃的\N{\fs50}I, uh, got some food in here still,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:39.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有你的手电筒\N{\fs50}and I got your light still.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:43.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fs50}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:44.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们往上爬\N{\fs50}We go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.15,0:23:45.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为上边视野更好？\N{\fs50}To get a better look?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.09,0:23:46.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,希望我们能找到条出去的路\N{\fs50}Hopefully, we spot a clear route out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.82,0:23:53.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跟紧了\N{\fs50}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.43,0:23:56.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fs50}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.95,0:24:18.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,布莱恩！\N{\fs50}Bryan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.79,0:24:20.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,布莱恩！\N{\fs50}Bryan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.58,0:24:24.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,发现尸体 发现尸体！\N{\fs50}Body, body!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.12,0:24:25.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们他妈的杀了布莱恩！\N{\fs50}They got fuckin' Bryan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:43.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说过了 就我一个人\N{\fs50}I told you. I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.98,0:24:46.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那天晚上以后我没见过那些人\N{\fs50}I haven't seen any of those people since that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.11,0:24:51.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还想听我说什么？\N{\fs50}What else do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:53.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说不好 说真话？\N{\fs50}I don't know. The truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:58.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳\N{\fs50}Kathleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:25:02.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,博格奎斯特一家 见过吗？没有？\N{\fs50}The Bergquists, hm? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.79,0:25:06.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,马克·安东尼·哈尔平\N{\fs50}Mark Anthony Halpin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.50,0:25:09.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凯莉·施莱伯 你没见过他们？\N{\fs50}Carrie Schreiber. You haven't seen them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:13.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,陈家呢？亨利·布瑞尔\N{\fs50}The Chans? Henry Burrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.89,0:25:17.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:22.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道亨利在哪儿\N{\fs50}You know where Henry is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.94,0:25:27.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,律师\N{\fs50}Lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.27,0:25:29.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,医疗护理\N{\fs50}Medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.90,0:25:32.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,家属探望\N{\fs50}Family visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:41.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在想 是不是就是这间牢房……\N{\fs50}I wonder if this is the cell...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.41,0:25:44.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我哥哥被活活打死那间\N{\fs50}where my brother was beaten to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.29,0:25:46.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们被冤枉了\N{\fs50}Oh, you were wronged.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:50.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.05,0:25:53.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但这也太过火了\N{\fs50}But this has gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:25:56.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,该停手了\N{\fs50}It has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:26:00.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 你是说 现在该停手了\N{\fs50}Oh, it has to stop now, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.05,0:26:03.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为现在你在监狱里\N{\fs50}Now that you're in the cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.64,0:26:07.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但在此之前 人死了就死了\N{\fs50}But before, people dying was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.14,0:26:08.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当时你安全且高枕无忧\N{\fs50}When you were safe and protected,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.73,0:26:10.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还向FEDRA出卖你的邻居\N{\fs50}and ratting on your neighbors to FEDRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:11.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们当时拿枪指着我脑袋\N{\fs50}They put a gun to my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.73,0:26:15.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.99,0:26:19.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在你愿意开口了吗？\N{\fs50}Have I satisfied the necessary conditions for you to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.05,0:26:20.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳 行行好\N{\fs50}Kathleen, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:25.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是我接生的\N{\fs50}I delivered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:30.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我亲手抱着你\N{\fs50}I held you in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.80,0:26:36.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我从来没和他们说过你哥哥的事\N{\fs50}I never told them anything about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.47,0:26:40.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但亨利说了\N{\fs50}But Henry did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:45.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而我们知道他还在城里\N{\fs50}And we know that he's still in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.77,0:26:47.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想你也知道\N{\fs50}And I think that you know that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.07,0:26:55.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.53,0:27:02.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你以为我下不了手？\N{\fs50}You think I won't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:15.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是你的医生\N{\fs50}I'm your doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:41.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谁干的？\N{\fs50}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:43.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们认为是外边来的人\N{\fs50}We think it was outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.49,0:27:45.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们找到了一辆卡车 装满了东西\N{\fs50}We found a truck, loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.33,0:27:48.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是FEDRA的载具 但补给充足\N{\fs50}It's not a FEDRA vehicle, but they were heavily supplied.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:49.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能是佣兵\N{\fs50}Could be mercs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.37,0:27:52.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 亨利万一有了无线电……\N{\fs50}Well, if Henry has a radio...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.33,0:27:53.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能他找来了外边的人\N{\fs50}maybe he found someone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.71,0:27:56.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许是他叫来了这些家伙\N{\fs50}Maybe he called these guys in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:01.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他还有救吗？\N{\fs50}Will he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.85,0:28:09.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果有医生呢？\N{\fs50}What if I had a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.10,0:28:11.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没救了 我很抱歉\N{\fs50}There's no chance. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.37,0:28:28.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把门打开\N{\fs50}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是亨利干的好事\N{\fs50}This is Henry's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.95,0:28:44.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fs50}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.55,0:28:48.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在我们阻止他之前 他是不会罢手的\N{\fs50}And he won't stop until we stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:50.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找到是谁干的\N{\fs50}Find who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.37,0:28:53.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找到所有同伙\N{\fs50}Find every collaborator
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:55.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,统统杀死\N{\fs50}and kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.70,0:29:31.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们不是FEDRA的人 也不是火萤的人\N{\fs50}They're not FEDRA, and they're not Fireflies,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.45,0:29:32.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那他们是谁？\N{\fs50}so who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.93,0:29:34.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人\N{\fs50}People.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.77,0:29:36.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们待这里边没问题吧？\N{\fs50}Are we okay in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.02,0:29:40.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,暂时应该没事\N{\fs50}For a little bit, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:43.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看起来他们会先去搜查公寓楼\N{\fs50}Looks like they're checkin' out apartment buildings first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.38,0:29:47.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但他们很快就会来到这一片\N{\fs50}But they'll be coming through these places soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.79,0:30:01.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那边有栋楼很高 差不多在四个街区外\N{\fs50}There's a really tall building, like, four blocks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:02.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 看到了\N{\fs50}Yeah. Saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.61,0:30:03.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那 就去那儿？\N{\fs50}So that's the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.74,0:30:06.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只要我们听不到卡车了 我们就走人\N{\fs50}As soon as we don't hear a truck, we move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.26,0:30:10.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,全速过去\N{\fs50}Fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.86,0:30:25.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fs50}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:32.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fs50}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.58,0:30:34.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fs50}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.58,0:30:35.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.88,0:30:48.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,问题在于 我没注意到那人偷袭\N{\fs50}Thing is, is I didn't hear that guy comin',
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.68,0:30:50.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而……\N{\fs50}and...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.89,0:30:52.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不该被迫……\N{\fs50}you shouldn't have had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.14,0:30:54.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fs50}you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:30:57.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你庆幸我这么做了 对吧？\N{\fs50}Well, you're glad I did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.73,0:30:59.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你只是个孩子\N{\fs50}You're just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.81,0:31:03.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不该让你去寻思——\N{\fs50}You shouldn't know what it means to--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.65,0:31:09.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,杀了他的也不是你\N{\fs50}It's not like you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.41,0:31:11.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但……\N{\fs50}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.37,0:31:14.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,开枪还是——\N{\fs50}shootin' or--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.39,0:31:18.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么感觉……\N{\fs50}I know what it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:21.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你第一次 呃 这样……\N{\fs50}first time that you, uh, hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.48,0:31:22.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,伤害他人\N{\fs50}someone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.71,0:31:27.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你 呃……\N{\fs50}If you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.64,0:31:34.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这事我干不来\N{\fs50}I'm not good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.99,0:31:35.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 你真不行\N{\fs50}Yeah, you really aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.85,0:31:37.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 这是我的错\N{\fs50}I mean, it was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.02,0:31:39.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不该被迫动手的\N{\fs50}You shouldn't have had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.56,0:31:44.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.29,0:32:07.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是我第一次动手\N{\fs50}It wasn't my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.11,0:32:30.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我看看你怎么握枪的\N{\fs50}Show me your grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.61,0:32:34.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,手指别放扳机上\N{\fs50}Finger off the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.99,0:32:37.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 谁教你这么握的？\N{\fs50}Now, who taught you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.05,0:32:37.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA的学校\N{\fs50}FEDRA school.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.83,0:32:40.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想来也是\N{\fs50}Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:42.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的大拇指——\N{\fs50}Your thumb--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.12,0:32:43.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,搭在另一个大拇指上\N{\fs50}over your thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.96,0:32:46.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,用左手……握紧右手\N{\fs50}Left hand... squeezes down on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.96,0:32:49.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,握住了吗？\N{\fs50}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.75,0:32:52.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fs50}There ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.30,0:32:55.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fs50}Look it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.77,0:33:03.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会了？\N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.62,0:33:23.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行 把它放包里\N{\fs50}Uh-uh. You put it in your pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.08,0:33:26.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,小心把屁股给打花了\N{\fs50}You'll shoot your damn ass off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.66,0:34:02.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们能撑过去的\N{\fs50}We'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.91,0:34:04.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fs50}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.55,0:34:22.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有他们的踪迹 你呢？\N{\fs50}No sign of them. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.81,0:34:26.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.82,0:35:57.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们没吃的了\N{\fs50}They're out of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.07,0:36:00.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利不会让山姆饿着\N{\fs50}Henry won't let Sam starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.15,0:36:02.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在我们的食品供应区加一倍人手\N{\fs50}Double the guards around our provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.78,0:36:04.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他他妈近得很 我感觉得到\N{\fs50}He's fucking close. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:06.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.04,0:36:11.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.52,0:36:39.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.05,0:36:52.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.55,0:37:02.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们什么时候告诉别人？\N{\fs50}When do we tell the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.66,0:37:06.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在不行\N{\fs50}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.47,0:37:09.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,先把眼前的事情给办了\N{\fs50}Let's just handle what we have to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.12,0:37:10.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,之后我们再处理这个\N{\fs50}We can deal with this after.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.24,0:37:10.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳——\N{\fs50}Kathleen--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.78,0:37:12.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,之后再说\N{\fs50}After.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.89,0:37:15.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,先把楼给封起来\N{\fs50}Seal off the building for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.73,0:37:18.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.77,0:37:19.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.43,0:37:30.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你用脚踩这里\N{\fs50}You're just gonna put your foot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.79,0:37:32.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一 二——\N{\fs50}One, two--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.54,0:37:33.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操 我操 我操\N{\fs50}Oh shit, oh shit, oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.89,0:37:35.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,站直了 有我在呢\N{\fs50}Straighten up. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.04,0:37:40.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 我进来了\N{\fs50}Okay, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.98,0:37:42.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,先看看四周\N{\fs50}Take a look around first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.21,0:37:44.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.74,0:37:46.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fs50}Goddamnit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.30,0:37:50.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没我可咋办啊？\N{\fs50}Where would you be without me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.72,0:37:52.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要没你 我都到怀俄明了\N{\fs50}By now, Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.41,0:37:53.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 对哦\N{\fs50}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.43,0:37:54.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这句我自找的\N{\fs50}Walked into that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.49,0:38:07.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 我们往上走 到了早上\N{\fs50}All right. We'll make our way up, and come morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.61,0:38:10.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我再看看这城市的状况 找条路出去\N{\fs50}I'll take a look at the city, and find our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.83,0:38:16.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要爬42层？\N{\fs50}We're goin' up 42 flights?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.69,0:38:18.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,45层\N{\fs50}Forty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:25.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但不用……不用爬完\N{\fs50}But no... not all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.57,0:38:27.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爬多高？\N{\fs50}How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.93,0:38:31.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爬到我爬不动为止\N{\fs50}As far as I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.95,0:38:59.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 你记得那个说自己受伤的人吗？\N{\fs50}Hey, you know that guy who said he was hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.21,0:39:01.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道那是埋伏？\N{\fs50}How did you know it was an ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.00,0:39:07.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这事我干过\N{\fs50}I've been on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.01,0:39:11.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很久以前了 为了生存 只能这么做\N{\fs50}It was a long time ago. We did what we needed to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.39,0:39:13.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你和泰丝？\N{\fs50}You and Tess?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.26,0:39:15.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有当时在一起的人\N{\fs50}And the people we were with.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.35,0:39:18.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和我弟弟\N{\fs50}My brother, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.48,0:39:26.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你杀过无辜的人吗？\N{\fs50}Did you kill innocent people?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:37.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fs50}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.34,0:39:47.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fs50}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.36,0:39:52.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,33层 真牛逼\N{\fs50}Thirty-three floors. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.26,0:39:53.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也只能到此为止了\N{\fs50}It's gonna have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.97,0:39:59.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走了\N{\fs50}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.08,0:40:00.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我歇一下\N{\fs50}Gimme a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:02.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快起来 懒骨头\N{\fs50}Get up, you lazy ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.59,0:40:07.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,懒骨头\N{\fs50}Lazy ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.13,0:40:10.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都56了 你个小王八蛋\N{\fs50}Fifty-six years old, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.67,0:40:28.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.92,0:40:31.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.38,0:40:34.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.14,0:40:35.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.99,0:40:37.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fs50}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.89,0:40:40.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想睡着的时候被人偷袭\N{\fs50}I don't want someone sneakin' up on us while we're sleepin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.91,0:40:42.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 我懂了\N{\fs50}Ohh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.06,0:40:44.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一踩就咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓\N{\fs50}Crunch, crunch, crunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.94,0:40:46.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你确定你听得见吗？\N{\fs50}Are you sure you're gonna hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.27,0:40:48.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我当然听得见 不然我撒什么\N{\fs50}Of course, I'll hear it. That's the damn point.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.11,0:40:49.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.11,0:40:52.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那 晚安\N{\fs50}Well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.49,0:40:56.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 晚安\N{\fs50}Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.80,0:41:18.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs50}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.87,0:41:19.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fs50}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.02,0:41:23.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们说到伤害别人的时候……\N{\fs50}When we were talkin' about hurtin' people...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.14,0:41:27.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说这不是你第一次 是什么意思？\N{\fs50}what did you mean it wasn't your first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.82,0:41:34.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想说这个\N{\fs50}I don't wanna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.82,0:41:39.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.33,0:41:48.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不必说\N{\fs50}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.67,0:41:51.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我只是想说……\N{\fs50}I'm just sayin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.01,0:41:57.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这并不公平 在你这个年纪……\N{\fs50}it isn't fair, your age...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.89,0:42:00.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就得承受这些——\N{\fs50}havin' to deal with all of this--
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.35,0:42:06.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以等你年纪大了 就会轻松些？\N{\fs50}So it gets easier when you get older?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.06,0:42:11.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 并不会\N{\fs50}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.52,0:42:13.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但还是\N{\fs50}But still.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.07,0:42:22.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我问你能不能听到玻璃声是因为\N{\fs50}The reason I asked whether you'd hear the glass or not
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.62,0:42:26.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发现你右耳听力不太好\N{\fs50}is 'cause I've noticed you don't hear too well from your right side.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.16,0:42:28.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你那里被枪打过吗？\N{\fs50}Is it 'cause you were shot there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.96,0:42:31.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大概是因为开枪太多\N{\fs50}Probably more from shootin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:34.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以要想保住听力 你就接着用刀\N{\fs50}So if you wanna keep your hearin', you stick to that knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.22,0:42:44.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,-乔尔？ - 嗯？\N{\fs50}-Joel? -Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.02,0:42:48.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道腹泻会遗传吗？\N{\fs50}Did you know diarrhea is hereditary?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.27,0:42:50.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.46,0:42:51.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.04,0:42:54.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为它流淌在你的裤子里\N{\fs50}It runs in your jeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.51,0:42:57.77,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,jeans（牛仔裤）谐音genes（基因）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.74,0:43:03.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fs50}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:08.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这也太他妈蠢了\N{\fs50}That is so goddamn stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.85,0:43:09.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你都笑了 大傻逼\N{\fs50}You laughed, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.98,0:43:10.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我才没笑\N{\fs50}I didn't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.58,0:43:11.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你明明笑了\N{\fs50}Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.48,0:43:13.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天 我要疯了\N{\fs50}Jesus, I'm losin' it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.27,0:43:15.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你都疯离谱了\N{\fs50}You're losin' it big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.23,0:43:31.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快睡觉\N{\fs50}Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.13,0:43:33.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你才应该快点睡……\N{\fs50}You go to sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.99,0:43:48.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.16,0:43:50.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.55,0:44:06.80,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,Lotte Kestner翻唱《True Faith》，发表于2011年\N原唱New Order，原作发表于1987年
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.80,0:44:14.25,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,2020年，电子游戏《最后生还者 第二部》的广告片\N（"True Faith" Extended Commercial）中使用了此翻唱版本
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.25,0:44:19.82,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我感觉超凡脱俗 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ I feel so extraordinary ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.90,0:44:25.16,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 有种东西抓住了我 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Something's got a hold on me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.24,0:44:30.75,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我感觉我动了起来 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ I got this feelin' I'm in motion ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.83,0:44:36.46,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 一种突如其来的自由 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ A sudden sense of liberty ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:41.53,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我不在乎 因为我不在那儿 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ I don't care 'cause I'm not there ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.53,0:44:47.22,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 而我不在乎 明天我是否还在 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ And I don't care if I'm here tomorrow ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.30,0:44:52.98,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 一次又一次 我承受了太多 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Again and again, I've taken too much ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.06,0:44:58.02,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 而你也为此付出了太多 ♪\N{\fs50}♪ Of the things that cost you too much ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.11,0:45:04.91,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我曾以为那一天永远不会来…… ♪\N{\fs50}♪ I used to think that the day would never come... ♪
